 defaults with per-region ehcache metrics vs\n  hibernate.cache.use_second_level_cache=off).\n- run-simulation-sidecars.sh: wraps run-simulation.sh with a\n  pg_stat_activity sampler (connection states, wait classes,\n  idle-in-transaction age) and an /api/metrics sampler (pool gauges,\n  JVM thread states, periodic full snapshots for per-region cache\n  stat deltas); output lands in the run bundle under sidecar/.\n- run-simulation.sh: DHIS_CONF_FILE validation + reproduction metadata,\n  optional COMPOSE_EXTRA_FILE compose override hook.","author":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"netroms@gmail.com"},"id":"38bc2ba1144006c831601812f7eab113bf3da0ff","tree_id":"ec3036ddcbb46b778764f731b3c35bd8d4b1c5d6","timestamp":"2026-08-06T04:38:21Z","committer":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"netroms@gmail.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web